WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.727
Unit seventeen. Copy and Paste Basics!

2
00:00:05.664 --> 00:00:10.108
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.158 --> 00:00:14.284
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:18.610
Today we learn about Copy and Paste Basics. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:23.608
Copy. Say it with me. Copy!

6
00:00:27.054 --> 00:00:30.641
Paste. Say it with me. Paste!

7
00:00:34.137 --> 00:00:37.956
Select. Say it with me. Select!

8
00:00:41.521 --> 00:00:45.642
Highlight. Say it with me. Highlight!

9
00:00:49.113 --> 00:00:53.213
Duplicate. Say it with me. Duplicate!

10
00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:01.456
Keyboard shortcut. Say it with me. Keyboard shortcut!

11
00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:08.749
Text. Say it with me. Text!

12
00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:15.978
Move. Say it with me. Move!

13
00:01:19.484 --> 00:01:28.541
I select and highlight text to copy it. Then I can paste it somewhere else. This duplicates the text without retyping it.

14
00:01:28.591 --> 00:01:31.729
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:32.455 --> 00:01:37.795
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.845 --> 00:01:38.995
Select!

17
00:01:39.862 --> 00:01:45.381
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.431 --> 00:01:46.581
Text!

19
00:01:47.562 --> 00:01:55.314
Did you know? Copy and paste was invented decades ago and is still one of the most-used computer commands today!

20
00:01:55.364 --> 00:01:57.680
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:58.614 --> 00:02:07.621
Think and answer. Why is copy and paste a useful computer skill?

22
00:02:07.671 --> 00:02:08.867
Great answer!

23
00:02:09.777 --> 00:02:15.785
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:18.923
